  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">West Africa Regional Programmes Adviser</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity West Africa Regional Programmes Adviser is a component of Support to West African Regional Integration Programme (SWARIP) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;563,354. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Transport policy and administrative management, Trade policy and administrative management, Trade facilitation, Public finance management (PFM), Regional trade agreements (RTAs), Research/scientific institutions, Public sector policy and administrative management, Women&apos;s rights organisations and movements, and government institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
